Subject: [PATCH 09/19] matsu: Configure AMP_MUTE_ODL signal

ALC721 has PD# pin and connected to EC. Mute system speakers during
power transitions until AP starts up.

BUG=b:443612246
TEST=zmake build matsu
LOW_COVERAGE_REASON=b:444086749 will add test code after bring up.

Change-Id: I8d8b233d8dc0582797a7cc800bec24c605d4a5b1
